"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209660/extras/366966c386fac4256bb74f05b60fc64c.poster.avif?t=1765464877\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209660/extras/366966c386fac4256bb74f05b60fc64c.webm?t=1765464877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209660/extras/366966c386fac4256bb74f05b60fc64c.mp4?t=1765464877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re bringing back all your favourite cosmetic types, but what\u2019s a new game without something fresh? Introducing Hole Explosions a brand-new way to celebrate every shot! Sink the ball and watch as dazzling effects burst from the hole, making every victory feel even more rewarding. From fiery blasts to playful confetti showers, customize your perfect finishing touch and make your mark on the course like never before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209660/extras/5e0b11f09418850c4eaf973f7b662061.avif?t=1765464877\" alt=\"Reward System\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our previous game, we noticed that not everyone knew how to unlock or equip customization items for their golf ball. That\u2019s why we\u2019ve introduced a brand-new, intuitive rewards system that clearly shows how to earn the cosmetics you want. Every item in this system is completely free to unlock no purchases, just play and customize your way!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Radical Forge","Team17"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","i